WEBVTT

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.820
I'll wait one week.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:31.350
Please give me an answer
one week from today.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.730
B-But--

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.450
Coach Mitaka's
sure playing hard!

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.720
Did something happen
between you and Coach Mitaka?

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.450
You're not your
usual self today.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:44.790
N-No. Of course not.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.200
All right, if you say so.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.980
See ya.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:52.310
I gotta stop at the bank
on the way home.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.250
Okay.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.100
That glum look
doesn't suit you.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.410
Bye!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:14.630
Good workout.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.360
Two more days...

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:19.940
Isn't it?

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.040
Good-bye.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:05.780
Um--

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:10.570
Um--

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.950
Um... Uh...

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.560
Um... Um...

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:20.930
Help me, my dears!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:24.890
Hm...?

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.250
Whose dogs are you?

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.670
I'm sorry!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.200
Oh, you're--

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.810
My...

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.370
You must be--
from the other day?

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.510
Are they yours?

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:43.580
Yes. His name is Foie Gras
and this one's Terrine.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:46.640
So you have a lot of dogs.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.700
Yes. I love them.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:49.420
Um--

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.260
Yes?

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.090
That man--

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.380
Oh, you mean Coach Mitaka?

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.860
What is your
relationship to him?

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.030
Are you his lover?

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.630
Are you going to marry him?

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.070
Won't you please
break up with him?

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:09.570
I can't ask such
offensive questions!

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:11.750
Uh--

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:17.010
Besides, I'm nothing
but a woman he just met.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:19.970
What about Coach Mitaka?

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:24.050
I-It's nothing.
He seems like a very nice man.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.520
W-Well, have a nice day.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:29.200
Uh--

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.510
Bye!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:54.880
Godai!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:58.150
Will you be late today?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.380
It's Saturday, and I
don't have any plans.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.800
I should be back
by late afternoon.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:03.860
Why?

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:04.820
N-Nothing.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:08.500
Please come home
as early as you can.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:10.770
S-Sure.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.050
Only enough for one.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.080
Better go shopping, then!

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.620
What's making me so happy?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.200
Um--

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:27.860
We've been bumping into
each other a lot lately.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.270
What an incredible coincidence!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.490
"Coincidence"?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.320
Is there something
you want from me?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.430
Here's my chance!

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.070
Ask her to break it off
with Coach Mitaka.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.390
Uh--

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.820
My dogs keep running to you.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.390
Oh, please!

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.640
I swear, it's true.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.470
Dogs are a great
judge of character!

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:57.750
They'd never take
a liking to bad people.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.140
So... Uh--

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:05.080
You must be a wonderful person.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.150
Excuse me.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.860
Come on, Pot au Feu. This way.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:11.190
Good day.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.610
What a strange girl.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:27.330
Just because her dogs like me,
she assumes I'm a good person.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:32.450
Come to think of it
Soichiro loves Coach Mitaka.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.570
Dogs are a great judge
of character!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.520
They'd never take
a liking to bad people.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.560
Now that I think about it
he's a good person.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.240
He's very kind.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.450
He's always looking out for me.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.590
He told me he wants
to be by my side.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.580
See you later!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.600
Thank you!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.870
Godai!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.220
Sakamoto!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.610
No wonder I haven't seen you
around campus lately.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.790
So you work here, huh?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.620
How'd you know to find me here?

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.840
When I called your place
about the class party,

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:23.460
Mrs. Ichinose told me
I'd find you here.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.320
Was it today?

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.860
What? You forgot?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.830
Well, let's go.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.070
I can't.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.200
What? Gotta date?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:35.960
N-No, not really.

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:37.320
Well, then let's go.

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:39.970
Your attendance record's
not too good, you know.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.190
If you don't show
your face to the prof,

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:44.520
he won't give you credit.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:46.530
All right. I'll go.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.900
Godai's late...

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.650
Godai!

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.040
Hello? Otonashi speaking.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.390
It's me, Mitaka.

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.450
I wanted to confirm
about tomorrow.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:21.970
Yes.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:24.560
Three o'clock?

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:26.920
All right.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.400
Tomorrow will be the most
fateful day of my life.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.070
Yes.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.560
I'll be waiting for you.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.030
Let me have your answer.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:38.330
Yes.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:42.540
You hang up first.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:43.460
Yes.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.690
All you say is "yes."

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.650
Yes. N-No!
I'm hanging up, then.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:51.500
Yes.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:02.400
I see what's happening now.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.700
I'm afraid to make
my own decision.

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:08.540
I want someone to stop me.

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:11.200
Godai would surely--

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.360
He'd surely...stop me.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.340
Where to next?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.210
Actually, I have a great idea.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:27.950
Well, I'll be going now!

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:30.160
Where d'ya think
you're goin', Godai? !

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.090
Aren't you comin' with us
to the next place?

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:34.230
B-But--

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.170
What? Short on cash?

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:39.070
N-No.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.660
Please come home
as early as you can.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:46.960
No? Then you gotta come.
We'll go somewhere you'd love.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:50.610
Oh, what the hell.
It's not like we had a date.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.110
You said you'd
be back early.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:07.930
Must you look
so disappointed to see us?

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.220
A no-show dinner guest?

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.940
What an exquisite spread
you have here.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:17.200
Making the Manager wait
like this? That's a crime.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.210
Sure is.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.570
So? Who's the criminal?

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.950
Coach Mitaka? Or is it Godai?

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.710
By the way, if it's Godai,
he's gonna be late.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:35.210
His friend Sakamoto
called this afternoon

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.520
to tell him about
their class party.

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.350
A party?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:43.360
Why couldn't he at least
phone me to tell me that?!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.100
We're here to cheer you up
tonight, Manager!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.960
Let the party begin!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.610
What do you mean,
cheer me up?

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:57.680
You've been kinda
down lately...

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.070
that's why.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:01.500
That's not true!
It's just that--

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:04.390
"It's just that--" what?

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:08.030
No need to get all huffy.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.060
Something happened between
you and Coach Mitaka, right?

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.340
Nothing happened!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:16.750
No sense lying. It's
written all over your face.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.530
Yeah. You're a bad liar.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.600
Never mind!
Let's lighten up!

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:25.460
Here's to the Manager's
bright future!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.400
And to us tenants' happiness!

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:29.240
Cheers!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.550
Dee-lish!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.070
What a great wine!

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:36.290
Yeah!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.580
Hey, let's get going, too.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.390
But we missed the last train.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:07.400
Shoot. Better hail a cab, then.

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.000
Y'got cab fare?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.700
No... You?

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:16.560
I spent every yen I had
at that cabaret place.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.570
S-So what're we
supposed to do?

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.550
We'll figure out somethin'.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:29.520
"Figure out somethin"'?
Whaddaya--?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.450
Hey!

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:47.410
You said you'd be back
in the evening!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.310
I have to give him
an answer today.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.560
Please...

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.870
Please come home soon.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:32.520
Tell me not to marry him.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.960
It's been a while since
I goofed around all night.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.580
We've walked for four hours.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.370
I'm pooped.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.460
Well, you're home safe.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.750
C-Can't be--

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.030
M-Manager!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.500
'Morning. You're up
bright and early.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.870
Good morning.

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.770
Mrs. Ichinose, too?!

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.200
Hey! It's the Manager!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.270
S-Sakamoto!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:30.400
Manager!

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:33.100
We're home!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.440
H-Hello.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.280
Her eyes are red!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:41.380
Was she up all night?

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.750
Out all night?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.990
Where were you?

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:49.420
Oh, please!
We can't tell you that!

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:51.090
It's embarrassing.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:54.400
Idiot! Now her imagination's
running wild!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.190
What's this?

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.510
Discount soap land?
"Melon Cream"?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.400
Oh, Mrs. Ichinose!

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:05.640
What's this one?

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:08.210
Tissue from
"College Gals' Pub"?

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:09.570
"Cabaret City"--

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.070
N-No!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:15.140
Some guys were passing
those out on the street!

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.590
And--

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.050
She didn't have to burn them.

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:44.020
No.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.190
Manager...

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.650
Where's she going,
all dressed up?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.930
Maybe she's got a date
with Coach Mitaka.

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:39.240
Wouldn't he come and pick
her up in his car, if it's a date?

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.390
I'm worried about her.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:45.500
She's been brooding
over something lately.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:46.840
You mean, the Manager?

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:50.280
She's been acting
weird all week.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:52.640
You didn't notice?

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:54.880
Not at all.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:19:01.650
You weren't home last night,
so we kept Manager company.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.060
But when we asked questions,
her mouth was zipped shut.

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.190
I have a hunch

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:10.440
she wanted to talk to you about
something really important.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:13.010
She was waiting for you
with dinner on the table.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.550
Dinner for me?

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.110
Yeah. She even had wine.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:22.280
A '77 vintage. It was delicious.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.760
Please come home early.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.140
I-I had no idea!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:02.810
2:40. It's almost time.

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:09.820
I shouldn't have pulled an
all-nighter For a guy like that!

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.750
Everyone, please
give me the courage...

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.190
to tell her today...

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.090
about Coach Mitaka!

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:46.700
Um--

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:52.400
Um--

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:57.480
Um--

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:05.690
Don't wake her!

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:09.120
She seems exhausted.
Let's wait until she wakes up.

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.360
W-What's going on?

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:23.860
W-Why are Kyoko and
Asuna here together?

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:26.200
And those--

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:38.370
H-How could that dog-girl be here
on a crucial day like this?

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:48.120
Where did they all go?

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.470
I'm sorry, sir!

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:56.630
Let me go find their
owner right away.

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:58.270
N-No!

00:21:58.600 --> 00:21:59.500
But--

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:02.320
I... I just...

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:05.100
love dogs!

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:22.300
Oh, my gosh!
When did I fall asleep?

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:25.880
Six o'clock?

00:22:27.100 --> 00:22:28.500
That's strange.

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:32.940
Didn't Coach Mitaka come?

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:44.210
That woman--

00:22:44.580 --> 00:22:46.680
She never got up, after all.

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:49.680
You all seem so happy.

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:52.340
Did something good
happen to you?

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:57.860
It's almost as if
you saw you-know-who.

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:08.710
He still hasn't come to?

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:14.290
Man, was I shocked!

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:16.880
He was having convulsions
right before my eyes!

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:22.910
Maybe we should've
called the ambulance.

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:30.550
DON'T COME ANY CLOSER!!

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.800
GO AWAY!!

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:47.980
Coach Mitaka's going
on a date with that woman?

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:50.880
Didn't he propose to you?
What's up with that?

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:54.570
Next: "Be Still, My Beating Heart!
Asuna's Very First Time!"

00:23:54.730 --> 00:23:57.630
I'm going to spend the rest
of my life with that man.

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:02.750
After all, he's the first man
who ever held me.
